licence that does not permit redistribution, and they remain the property of those
publishers. The raw exports and all abstracts are therefore absent from this
repository. Titles, journal names, publication years and DOIs are retained as
bibliographic facts, so that any record referred to here can be looked up in either
database by anyone holding their own subscription.

